      <div type="clause" n="2.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 2.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ic wille þæt woruldgerihta mid Denum standan be swa godum lagum, swa hy betste geceosan mægen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it is my will that the rights of the laity be maintained among the Danes in accordance with the best constitution which they can determine upon.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ic wille, þæt woruldgerihta mid Denum standan be swa godum lagum, swa hy betste geceosan mægen.</ab>
